text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_08171ED1 {
    "HUNTER’S HOUSE"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0624 {
    "Hey, are you lost at sea?\pIf you can beat my POKéMON, I can\nserve as your pilot."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0675 {
    "I lost my bearings in battle!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0693 {
    "Many people lose their bearings at sea.\pIf you’re that sort, you should refer\nto the POKéNAV’s MAP."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C06F7 {
    "Hm! You’re riding a POKéMON instead\nof swimming yourself...\pI am envious!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0741 {
    "Oh!\nI can’t..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0750 {
    "I’m getting chilled...\nI’ve been in the water too long...\pI wish I could ride a POKéMON like you..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C07B4 {
    "If you just float in the sea like\nthis, POKéMON come around to play."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C07F9 {
    "Oh...\nLost at sea..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C080E {
    "While swimming, I noticed that some\nPOKéMON attack, and some just watch.\pI guess POKéMON have personalities\nof their own."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0888 {
    "If you just float in the sea like this,\nTRAINERS challenge you!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C08C8 {
    "That’s strange...\nI lost again..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C08EA {
    "This has nothing to do with anything,\nbut maybe I’ll visit the TRICK HOUSE."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0936 {
    "I’m growing bored of swimming...\nHow about a battle?"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C096B {
    "I had no idea that you were\nthis strong!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0994 {
    "All the effort you put in must have\nmade you this strong."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C09CE {
    "Fufufufu... I dive deep underwater\nto go deep under cover.\lPlumbing the depths is where I excel!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0A2F {
    "Glub, glub, glub...\nI’m sinking..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0A52 {
    "I have it on good authority that\nthere’s a DIVE spot around here.\pIt gives me the urge to go deep\nagain..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0ABD {
    "RITA: Sigh...\pHere I am in the sea, but who’s with me?\nMy little brother!\pLet’s battle so I won’t have to dwell\non that!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0B36 {
    "RITA: SAM! It’s your fault we lost!\nYou’re in for it later!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0B72 {
    "RITA: Sigh...\pIf only it wasn’t my little brother\nnext to me, but a nice boyfriend..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0BC8 {
    "RITA: You’re planning to battle us?\nNot unless you have more POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0C0E {
    "SAM: My big sister is tough at POKéMON!\pDon’t cry when you lose!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0C4F {
    "SAM: Uh-oh...\nMy big sister will chew me out..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0C7F {
    "SAM: My big sister is really scary\nwhen she gets angry.\pThat’s why she doesn’t have a\nboyfriend."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0CE0 {
    "SAM: Did you want to battle us?\nBring some more POKéMON, then."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0D1F {
    "RITA: Sigh...\pHere I am in the sea, but who’s with me?\nMy little brother!\pOh, hi, it’s been a while. Let’s battle\nso I won’t have to dwell on things!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0DB5 {
    "RITA: SAM!\nIt’s your fault we lost again!\pWe’re having a training session later!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0E06 {
    "RITA: Sigh...\pIf I had a nice boyfriend, we’d beat\nanyone with lovely combinations..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0E5C {
    "RITA: You’re planning to battle us?\nNot unless you have more POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0EA2 {
    "SAM: If we lose, I’ll catch heck.\nI’m going to go totally all out!"
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0EE5 {
    "SAM: Uh-oh...\nMy big sister will chew me out again."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0F19 {
    "SAM: My big sister is really scary\nwhen she gets angry.\pShe’s going to make me train really\nhard with POKéMON later..."
}

text Naranja_Route124_G00_M39_Text_081C0F90 {
    "SAM: Did you want to battle us?\nBring some more POKéMON, then."
}
